<emph etype = "bold">
P25AB: Piston Cooling Oil Control Circuit High
</emph>
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
Piston cooling jet valve drive circuit is shorted to power supply.
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
(3 D/C detection logic)
</ptxt>
</entry>
